    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Veracode Applications REST API provides programmatic access to application profiles, sandboxes, and policy evaluations in the Veracode Platform. Enables automation of portfolio management, compliance tracking, and CI/CD integration. Authentication uses HMAC with API ID/key credentials.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Veracode Support",
